      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "AUG 2025\nOWN INFRASTRUCTURE\n\nSmall objects (median\n288 bytes) \u2192 Cloudflare's\nown distributed DB.\nLarger \u2192 R2.\n\np99 latency:\n~200ms \u2192 under 5ms.\n\nNo third-party cloud\nleft as a single\npoint of failure.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "AUG 2025\nOWN INFRASTRUCTURE\n\nSmall objects (median\n288 bytes) \u2192 Cloudflare's\nown distributed DB.\nLarger \u2192 R2.\n\np99 latency:\n~200ms \u2192 under 5ms.\n\nNo third-party cloud\nleft as a single\npoint of failure.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "footer",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 340,
      "width": 1200,
      "height": 40,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The redundancy was built in 2018 and quietly traded away for operational simplicity in early 2025 \u2014 the outage found exactly that gap.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The redundancy was built in 2018 and quietly traded away for operational simplicity in early 2025 \u2014 the outage found exactly that gap.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
